ording to Schr COT on Gen 10:6 , Dl Pa 51 ff. 72 f. and most Assyriologists; so perhaps also 2:13 (J), yet see Hpt Über Ld. u. Meer, 1894-5, No. 15 . II. כּוּשׁ proper name, masculine a Benjamite , Psa 7:1 (title), ᵐ5 Χουσει υιὁῦ Ιεμενει .","rootNote":"probably of foreign origin;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 1 8","keyReferences":["1Chr 1 8","1Chr 1 9","1Chr 1 10","2Kgs 19 9","Esth 1 1","Esth 8 9","Ezek 29 10","Ezek 30 4"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":30,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 1 8","book":"1Chr","chapter":1,"verse":8,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"כּ֥וּשׁ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"1Chr 1 9","book":"1Chr","chapter":1,"verse":9,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"כ֔וּשׁ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"1Chr 1 10","book":"1Chr","chapter":1,"verse":10,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/כ֖וּשׁ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Np"},{"reference":"2Kgs 19 9","book":"2Kgs","chapter":19,"verse":9,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"כּוּשׁ֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"Esth 1 1","book":"Esth","chapter":1,"verse":1,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"כּ֔וּשׁ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"Esth 8 9","book":"Esth","chapter":8,"verse":9,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"כּ֗וּשׁ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"Ezek 29 10","book":"Ezek","chapter":29,"verse":10,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"כּֽוּשׁ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"Ezek 30 4","book":"Ezek","chapter":30,"verse":4,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בְּ/כ֔וּשׁ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Np"},{"reference":"Ezek 30 5","book":"Ezek","chapter":30,"verse":5,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"כּ֣וּשׁ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"Ezek 30 9","book":"Ezek","chapter":30,"verse":9,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"כּ֣וּשׁ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"Ezek 38 5","book":"Ezek","chapter"